chunks.text:
[Creeping] {from the first beat: cellos and contrabasses pulse a low ostinato in eighths like slow footsteps, a muffled heartbeat drum on the beats, pizzicato violas ticking a nervous off-beat figure}
{a solo cello plays a dark, searching melody full of half steps, answered by a low flute; muted violins tremble in tremolo and swell up and fall back}
{now and then a low brass swell and a soft gong stroke, a sharp pizzicato stinger}

[Watched] {the same pulse and instruments, tension held but never released}
{the melody passes to a muted trumpet and the low flute in turn over the footsteps}
{dissonant string chords change every bar, a timpani roll creeps in and dies away}
